  "text": "This outfit is built on rich, warm tones: a deep brown blazer from Morandi defines your silhouette with structured shoulders and a tailored waist, layered under a navy ribbed dress that hugs your figure elegantly. The look is finished with sleek black mules from Emmelie De Lage, their cherry-print soles adding a playful yet sophisticated touch, and a soft grey suede clutch from The Originals to carry essentials in style. A camel coat wraps around it all for warmth and elegance as the evening deepens. The combination of structured tailoring, body-skimming knitwear, and sharp footwear creates a bold contrast that lets you stand out exactly as you wished—refined but unmistakably yours.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Wear the blazer buttoned at your waist when entering the restaurant to emphasize your defined shape, then unbutton it once seated for ease and breathability.",
    "Let the coat hang open over your shoulders as you arrive, revealing the dress underneath before settling into your seat or removing it if the room warms up."
